  "Do not shade or colour.",
  "Draw only a few representative cells, not the whole field of view, and show their true shapes.",
  "Draw label lines with a ruler, and the lines must not cross, and each must touch the part it labels.",
  "Give the drawing a title that names the specimen, and state the magnification used, for example Onion epidermal cells, ×100.",
